<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_3756890c1e5fc6e4f303d0d69c5e6674192365d99b5559676ac7dc7c72e24ed8_n0017/gr_0012> <http://digistrucmed.org/gradeDimension> "CERTAINTY_OF_EVIDENCE" .
